{"id":"629015","name":"酸汤樱桃萝卜","author":"厨色","authorId":"12901915","desc":"","cover":"images/629015/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"樱桃小萝卜","amount":"10个"}],"sub":[{"name":"蔓越莓","amount":"30克"},{"name":"柠檬","amount":"1片"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材准备好。","img":"images/629015/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"樱桃萝卜分割下来，清洗干净。","img":"images/629015/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"蔓越莓果放入汤锅，加入清水烧开。","img":"images/629015/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"汤汁煮成红色，放入白糖中和味道。","img":"images/629015/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"白糖融化后关火晾凉。","img":"images/629015/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"樱桃萝卜切蓑衣片，薄片，底部相连。","img":"images/629015/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入盐腌制15分钟。","img":"images/629015/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"腌好后用清水冲洗一遍。","img":"images/629015/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入器皿中。","img":"images/629015/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"倒入煮好的蔓越莓汤水。","img":"images/629015/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加入柠檬片增香，放入冰箱冷藏三个小时。","img":"images/629015/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"清凉开胃。","img":"images/629015/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}